OL,4,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,5,     GFrench violinist Theotime
OL,6,     GLanglois de Swarte makes a much-
OL,7,     Ganticipated Proms debut as
OL,8,     Gsoloist with his ensemble Le
OL,9,     GConsort in a programme built
OL,10,     Garound violin concertos by
OL,11,     GVivaldi.
